	20 FEB 2024
	init_sink.f90: For some strange reason, restarting with a sink without having previous sinks fails due to the absence of the sink_XXXXX.csv file (not sure why it worked before!). Made several changes to the block if(nrestart > 0) to fix (?) this issue.


